{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Neko": 20,
    "Paimon": 1,
    "Player": 7
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2204201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Neko",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220420101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220420101": {
            "id": "220420101",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "What an unteachable lot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420102"
            ]
          },
          "220420102": {
            "id": "220420102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420103"
            ]
          },
          "220420103": {
            "id": "220420103",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Ah, it's you. Those little ones have run off yet again. They really are growing most rebellious...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420106"
            ]
          },
          "220420106": {
            "id": "220420106",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Now that you have hung those metal balls around the shrine, I believe that they will be able to find their way back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420107"
            ]
          },
          "220420107": {
            "id": "220420107",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "It is not a bad thing, perhaps, for them to go a little wild outside, lest they make a fool of themselves in front of the humans and disgrace the shrine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420108"
            ]
          },
          "220420108": {
            "id": "220420108",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "But if they should go overboard and go hungry from when the sun hangs high to when the moon comes up... That would not be good either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420109"
            ]
          },
          "220420109": {
            "id": "220420109",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Well then, please bring these fish to those little rascals so that they may eat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204202",
      "subQuestName": "Feed the little cats with Fish",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220420201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220420201": {
            "id": "220420201",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Bring those fish to the little ones, and quickly. I have matters of the shrine to attend to yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204203",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220420301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220420301": {
            "id": "220420301",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "You have returned. Have you fed those rascals?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420302"
            ]
          },
          "220420302": {
            "id": "220420302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420303"
            ]
          },
          "220420303": {
            "id": "220420303",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Good, good. You have my thanks. Without your aid, those children would have played and played... and then they would have gone hungry outside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420304"
            ]
          },
          "220420304": {
            "id": "220420304",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "*sigh* What a bunch of disobedient children. How will they be fit to receive the people coming to the shrine this way..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204204",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Neko",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2204204",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220420401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220420401": {
            "id": "220420401",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "You have returned. It is strange. Those children suddenly all came back, and they looked mighty frightened, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420402"
            ]
          },
          "220420402": {
            "id": "220420402",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Did they meet some hairy churls outside, the ones with the sticks?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420403"
            ]
          },
          "220420403": {
            "id": "220420403",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Still, they did come back... Wait, what is the matter with you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420404"
            ]
          },
          "220420404": {
            "id": "220420404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Uh, actually, I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420405"
            ]
          },
          "220420405": {
            "id": "220420405",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "...You... unfathomable human! What possessed you to do that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420406"
            ]
          },
          "220420406": {
            "id": "220420406",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "You could simply have played with these children the normal way...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420407"
            ]
          },
          "220420407": {
            "id": "220420407",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Meow! No wonder they were so frightened... You must go and comfort them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220420408"
            ]
          },
          "220420408": {
            "id": "220420408",
            "speakerId": 3189,
            "speakerName": "Neko",
            "text": "Really, now. I suppose it was a bit much to ask for all humans to be like Hibiki..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}